{
  "name": "broken-relative-link",
  "domain": "tech-doc",
  "format": "doc-corpus-and-api-surface",
  "description": "链接断言这一类候选的最小案例：一篇文档的两个段落各含一条相对链接，候选就是这两条链接本身——它们可机械核验（目标路径存在与否），因此能被提出来；同一段落里「Point the client at …」这类散文句子不会被变成候选。",
  "input": {
    "format": "doc-corpus-and-api-surface",
    "payload": {
      "documents": [
        {
          "path": "docs/guide/setup.md",
          "title": "Setup",
          "sections": [
            { "anchor": "config", "text": "Point the client at your config with [config](../config.md)." },
            { "anchor": "troubleshooting", "text": "If the client fails to start, see [the troubleshooting page](./troubleshooting.md)." }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "api": []
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "candidates": 2,
    "paths": ["docs/guide/setup.md", "docs/guide/setup.md"],
    "admitted": 2,
    "excludedByPredicate": {},
    "bounded": true,
    "truncated": false
  },
  "anchors": {
    "positive": [
      {
        "note": "链接断言逐字锚定后，复核者才能对着它回答「这个目标文件存在吗」。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "section-and-signature",
          "path": "docs/guide/setup.md",
          "locator": { "docPath": "docs/guide/setup.md", "anchor": "config", "claimKind": "link" },
          "excerpt": "Point the client at your config with [config](../config.md)."
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "docs/guide/setup.md",
          "content": "Point the client at your config with [config](../config.md).\nIf the client fails to start, see [the troubleshooting page](./troubleshooting.md).\n",
          "sections": [{ "anchor": "config" }, { "anchor": "troubleshooting" }]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "recomputed-unique",
        "expectStart": 1
      }
    ],
    "negative": [
      {
        "note": "转述不锚定：把链接文字改掉（`[config]` → `[the config file]`），即使读者一看就懂指的是同一处，锚点也不认。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "section-and-signature",
          "path": "docs/guide/setup.md",
          "locator": { "docPath": "docs/guide/setup.md", "anchor": "config", "claimKind": "link" },
          "excerpt": "Point the client at your config with [the config file](../config.md)."
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "docs/guide/setup.md",
          "content": "Point the client at your config with [config](../config.md).\n"
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "no-match"
      }
    ],
    "ambiguous": [
      {
        "note": "同一条链接在同一篇文档里出现两次时不猜位置：交给复核者补足上下文。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "section-and-signature",
          "path": "docs/guide/setup.md",
          "locator": { "docPath": "docs/guide/setup.md", "anchor": "config", "claimKind": "link" },
          "excerpt": "See [config](../config.md)."
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "docs/guide/setup.md",
          "content": "See [config](../config.md).\nSee [config](../config.md).\n"
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "relocation-ambiguous",
        "expectAmbiguousIn": ["docs/guide/setup.md:1", "docs/guide/setup.md:2"]
      }
    ]
  }
}
